DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260516
DTSTAMP:20261107T163656Z
UID:acc9d8e1d1bdab34c6766b602473@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Beyond the Brewhouse Where: Newport Craft Brewing and Distilli
 ng\, 293 JT Connell Road\, Newport 45 minutes: $20 per person Did you know
  that we are a Distillery too? Going beyond the brewhouse\, our expert tou
 r guide will provide you with an in-depth explanation of our brewing and d
 istilling processes. Tour the brewhouse\, take a peek at our Sour room\, a
 nd walk through our distillery. Conclude the tour with a brew and spirit f
