BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A New England Thanksgiving
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261107
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261108
DTSTAMP:20261107T163656Z
UID:6f1a0ecba10ef48887051594bc87@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Join the Coggeshall staff as we prepare a Thanksgiving meal ov
 er the hearth in our historic farmhouse. The late 18th century was before 
 the official start of Thanksgiving as a national holiday\, but the day was
  still celebrated with food and prayer in New England. Watch our costumed 
 historians make chicken on a string\, bake a pie in the hot coals\, mash t
 urnips and churn butter. In the woodshop we will also demonstrate carving 
 wooden spoons. Explore the garden to see the last of the fall harvest. Wal
 k the nature trail and look for signs of wild turkey\, see musket demonstr
 ations and try your aim with rubber band targets. Please note: This is not
  a Thanksgiving meal for visitors to eat. Food prepared in the historic Fa
 rmhouse Kitchen does not meet modern health and food preparation codes for
  public consumption.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/a-n
 ew-england-thanksgiving/112116/
LOCATION:Coggeshall Farm Museum\, 1 Colt Drive\, Bristol\, 02809 Time: 10:
 00 AM to 4:00 PM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/a-new-england-thanksgiving/1121
 16/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Asbury UMC Annual Christmas Village Bazaar
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261107
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261108
DTSTAMP:20261107T163656Z
UID:c50e3f1a76f5aeddda793ebe85f2@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our free annual Christmas Village Bazaar Saturday
 \, November 7 from 9am til 2pm. Asbury UM Church is located at 550 Fair St
 reet just off Narragansett Parkway in Warwick RI. Baked goods\, including 
 our famous Swedish coffee bread\, gift baskets\, jewelry\, toys\, Christma
 s decor\, household gifts\, purses and more! We have food\, too so stay fo
 r lunch or take it with you! There is no admission charge and the event is
  inside the church so no weather issues! Proceeds help us in our mission. 
 A great way to find gifts for others and yourself! We can’t wait to gree
 t you November 7!\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/asbury
 -umc-annual-christmas-village-bazaar/112487/
LOCATION:Asbury United Methodist Church\, 550 Fair St\, Warwick\, 02888
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/asbury-umc-annual-christmas-vil
 lage-bazaar/112487/
END:VEVENT
