SUMMARY:Sparkling Lights at The Breakers
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261122
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
DTSTAMP:20261107T163656Z
UID:d5932912a26459263f74067ed3d2@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Sparkling Lights at The Breakers presented by BankNewport When
 : November 21 &#8211\; December 27\, 2026 from 4:00 - 8:00 PM November 21
 \, 22\, 27\, 28\, and 29 December 3\, 4\, 5\, 6\, 10\, 11\, 12\, 13\, 18\,
  20\, 21\, 22\, 23\, 26\, and 27 Timed Admission: 4:00\, 4:30\, 5:00\, 5:3
 0\, and 6:00 PM (House and grounds will close at 8:00 PM) Where: The Break
 ers\, 44 Ochre Point Avenue\, Newport Tickets: $45 Adult Non-Member $18 Yo
 uth Non-Member (Ages 6-12) $30 Adult Member $18 Youth Member (Ages 6-17) F
 ree for Children younger than 6 Now in its 7th season\, Sparkling Lights a
 t The Breakers brings the magic of the holidays to this landmark Gilded Ag
 e mansion. Stroll along a half-mile-long path glittering with hundreds of 
 thousands of holiday lights while music fills the winter air. See illumina
 ted displays and sparkling surprises along the way. Tour the opulent inter
 ior of The Breakers decorated in holiday splendor. Enjoy holiday treats an
 d adult beverages for purchase at the back terrace and The Breakers Welcom
 e Center. A special Member Night will be held December 13 during which mem
 bers and their guests will enjoy special offerings including giveaways and
  family activities.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/spar
 kling-lights-at-the-breakers/112249/
LOCATION:The Breakers\, 44 Ochre Point Avenue\, Newport\, RI 02840
